@startuml
title 用户账号注销流程（开发环境）

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true

actor User as user
participant "Flutter App" as app
participant "Account Deletion API" as api
database "account_deletion_requests" as requests
participant "Blocker Port" as blocker
participant "SMS / Google" as stepup
database "Application DB" as db
participant "Media Worker" as media
collections "Object Storage" as storage

note over api,blocker
  Production: always disabled (503)
  Development bypass: explicit switches only,
  restricted to test accounts with no commerce data
end note

user -> app: Start deletion
app -> api: POST /preflight (Bearer)
api -> blocker: evaluate(userId)

alt Business blockers found
  blocker --> api: blockers
  api -> requests: persist ineligible request
  api --> app: 200 eligible=false + blockers
  app --> user: Show type, count, action only
else Blocker service unavailable
  blocker --> api: Unavailable
  api --> app: 503 stable errorCode
else Eligible
  blocker --> api: Eligible
  api -> requests: create or reuse active request + policyVersion
  api --> app: requestId, method, masked credential

  alt SMS step-up
    app -> api: POST /send-sms-code(requestId)
    api -> requests: store HMAC(phone + code) + expiry + attempts
    api -> stepup: send SMS (or dev-only fixed-code adapter)
    stepup --> api: accepted
    api --> app: resend/expiry metadata
    app -> api: POST /step-up(requestId, code)
  else Google step-up
    app -> stepup: request Google ID Token
    stepup --> app: ID Token
    app -> api: POST /step-up(requestId, ID Token)
    api -> stepup: verify issuer, audience,\nemail_verified and exact email
  end

  api -> requests: store authorization hash (600s)
  api --> app: one-time deletionAuthorization
  app -> app: securely persist pending
  note right of app
    requestId + policyVersion
    idempotencyKey + authorization
    Pending is written before confirm
  end note

  app -> api: POST /confirm (Bearer + exact pending tuple)
  api -> db: BEGIN; lock user row
  api -> blocker: final evaluate(userId)

  alt Final check blocked
    blocker --> api: blockers
    api -> requests: consume authorization;\npersist terminal BLOCKED
    api -> db: COMMIT (no erasure writes)
    api --> app: 409 + stable errorCode
  else Blocker service unavailable
    blocker --> api: Unavailable
    api -> db: ROLLBACK
    api --> app: 503 + stable errorCode
  else Final check eligible
    blocker --> api: Eligible
    api -> requests: verify and consume authorization;\nbind idempotency key
    api -> db: revoke refresh tokens
    api -> db: clean in-scope private data;\nanonymize PII; set ERASED
    api -> db: mark owned media PENDING
    api -> requests: persist success terminal outcome
    api -> db: COMMIT
    api --> app: success terminal outcome

    par Client completion
      app -> app: completeAccountDeletion(userId)
      app -> app: clear pending after all local cleanup succeeds
      app --> user: Signed out; deletion complete
    else After-commit media deletion
      api -> media: wake worker after commit
      media -> db: scan PENDING / RETRY rows
      media -> storage: idempotent delete(storageKey)
      alt File deleted or already absent
        storage --> media: success / not found
        media -> db: mark DELETED
      else Temporary failure
        storage --> media: failure
        media -> db: increment attempt; mark RETRY
        media -> media: retry with alert at limit
      end
    end
  end
end

== Crash and response-loss recovery ==

... App restarts with pending marker ...
app -> app: remain signed out; load exact pending tuple first
app -> api: POST /confirm without Bearer

alt Exact terminal record matches all hashes and parameters
  api -> requests: read terminal outcome only
  requests --> api: terminal success / terminal failure
  api --> app: original terminal outcome (no writes)
  alt Success
    app -> app: finish local cleanup; delete pending
  else Explicit blocker or expired authorization
    app -> app: clear pending; restore original account if still valid
  end
else No exact terminal match
  api --> app: 401 / 410 (no mutation)
  app -> app: keep pending and signed out on unknown/network state
end

note over db,storage
  No order, payment, refund, wallet, settlement,
  review, or direct-message table is read or written.
  users.deleted_at is ignored by account lifecycle logic.
end note

legend right
  Update this PUML as implementation changes.
  Diagram image is generated manually by the user.
endlegend

@enduml
